<title>UK: Sims Food names Cearns finance director.</title>
<headline>Sims Food names Cearns finance director.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sims Food Group Plc on Friday said it named Tony Cearns as finance director and company secretary, effective September 16.</p>
<p>Cearns joins Sims Food from Deloitte and Touche. He succeeds Stephen Collier as finance director. Collier in June assumed the position of chief executive.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
